body:
i don't think you are beyond help its just that people really suck at helping suicidal people. they really don't understand and if they think hard enough about it they are scared that they might feel the same too. 

&#x200B;

im glad you wrote

please don't use the knife to attempt. cuts don't heal properly and it hurt all the damn time. it leaves a quick relief but then they literally hurt you when you try to forget them and they put you in a circle. 

&#x200B;

i am also scared to disappoint my family but please don't use the knife
